* Cost are base on currently shipping price,so for save cost/same time arrived,it's better to ship all together.
* If to ship batteries and scooters together,we have some concerns:

# The focus is to ship scooters assembled with batteries,then all containers will be DG,boat  booking will be difficult.
# Scooter's packing need to use DG cartons.
# Currently,batteries and scooters are come from different suppliers,that means one shipment we have to make booking 2 times,have 2 BLs,deal with customs 2 times at original /destination port etc. if batteries and scooters are both purchased via scooter manufacturers,then we just to deal with booking/original&destination customs once time one shipment,so that to improve customs clerance efficiency and reduce detention fees at customs.

